** Affected by {{M|damage block}} sources on the enemy individually within the area-of-effect.
** Has the following damage flags:
*** {{M|No-spell-lifesteal}}
*** {{M|No-spell-amplification}}
** Stack independently with other [[cleave]] sources.
** [[File:Dota2 Cleave Visualized icon-1.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cleave Visualized icon-2.png|84px]][[File:Dota2 Cleave Visualized icon-3.png|84px]]
*** The total ability area-of-effect is an {{Symbol|Facing Angle|r}} {{Symbol|Target|Cleave90}} [[wikipedia:Isosceles trapezoid|isocseles trapezoid]] in front of the Titan, starts from the attacked enemy unit [[File:Dota2 Letter-f.png|F|21px]] and ends at point [[File:Dota2 Letter-p.png|P|21px]] .
*** {{Code|FP {{=}} {{ValueColor||{{Show|A|Cleave|Cleave|value2}}|tal|x}}}}

 * {{cf|talnotes}} {{Symbol|Cleave}}
** The damage is applied immediately to all valid enemy units within the area-of-effect regardless of the ability visual effects.
** Does not proc [[cleave]] when attacking the following units:
*** {{M|Allied units|x}}.
** Does not damage the following units:
*** {{M|Couriers}}
** Neither proc nor damage the following units:
*** {{M|Buildings}}
*** {{M|Ward-type units}}.

