{{Stealnotes
| name = Astral Spirit
| desc = The {{U|Astral Spirit}} summoned does not have {{A|Elder Titan|Echo Stomp}} unless it is acquired as well.<br><br>Upon losing the ability, the Spirit disappears into the ground and does not grant any of its ability bonuses.
}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Astral Spirit icon0}}
| desc = Elder Titan sends forth his Astral Spirit, damaging any units it passes through.  When the spirit rejoins the Titan, it grants bonus damage and movement speed for each unit it passed through.<br><br>The Astral Spirit possesses the Echo Stomp, Return Spirit, and Natural Order abilities.
}}
* {{Symbol|Astral Spirit}}
** The Spirit has the following secondary properties:
*** {{Symbol|Move Speed}}
*** The [[set movement speed]] component has the following additional properties:
**** The value difference between the Titan's and the Spirit's movement speed is granted utilizing the set movement speed mechanic.
**** This ability component follows the general movement speed mechanics, and the Spirit has no movement speed cap.
***** Hence, it has a {{Show|U|Astral Spirit|movement speed}} ‒ {{Symbol|Inf}} min and max movement speed respectively.
*** {{hi|Elder Titan}}
**** The Titan unlocking [[max movement speed]] does not affect the Spirit's movement speed.
** {{Symbol|Astral Spirit}} {{Symbol|Death}}
*** The Spirit has no [[death]] animation.
<hr>
* {{cf|aghnotes}}
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}} {{Symbol|a|Up}} {{Symbol|Magic Resistance}}
*** Has {{Code|{{ValueColor||{{calc|1-(1-{{G|magic resistance}})*(1-v1)|v1={{#var:Astral Spirit type1 value5 agh}}|%}}|agh|x}} + {{ValueColor||{{calc|(1-v1)*{{G|bonus magic resistance}}|v1={{#var:Astral Spirit type1 value5 agh}}|%}}|agh|x}} × Σ[[Intelligence|Int]]}} {{M|magic resistance}} per stack.

